Le bouton fixe (left/right 16px) ajoutait son padding à la largeur (box-sizing content-box) : 48px de trop.
box-sizing: border-box dans la landing + overflow-x: clip par sécurité.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012bLQpdFSSZPuuoKv3SQWtB
---
 apps/web/components/landing/styles.ts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/web/components/landing/styles.ts b/apps/web/components/landing/styles.ts
index 54985eb..68b4b3e 100644
--- a/apps/web/components/landing/styles.ts
+++ b/apps/web/components/landing/styles.ts
@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@
 // Styles de la landing (tokens V2 : claude/DESIGN_UI_MALAFIPRO.md). Propriétés logiques (inline-start/end) : marche en RTL et LTR.
 export const CSS = `
 .lp a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
+.lp{overflow-x:clip}
+.lp *,.lp *::before,.lp *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
 .lp h3{color:inherit}
 .lp[lang=fr] h1,.lp[lang=fr] h2,.lp[lang=fr] h3{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans','IBM Plex Sans Arabic',sans-serif}
 .lp .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate}
-- 
